{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight in 64-player matches as the United States or the PAVN + Vietcong in a Conquest-style mode set during the Vietnam War. This demo features one large river delta map where helicopter transport is essential to reach the Vietnamese-held side, featuring a mix of open terrain and dense jungle combat zones. Engage in gritty infantry warfare using authentic weapons, grenades, mines, and built-in VOIP to coordinate with your team.<br><br><strong>Features available in this demo:</strong><br>\u2022 64-player online multiplayer<br>\u2022 One river delta map with Conquest-style objectives<br>\u2022 Infantry combat with deployables and explosives<br>\u2022 Helicopter transport and close air support<br>\u2022 United States vs. PAVN + Vietcong factions<br>\u2022 5 primary weapons + 2 sidearms per team<br>\u2022 English Menu and UI<br>\u2022 Steam integration &amp; in-game voice chat</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705210?t=1747070795","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705210?t=1747070795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705210/cbcf132ad4498341e71a406b3ab91e9aac5eb8d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747070795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705210/cbcf132ad4498341e71a406b3ab91e9aac5eb8d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747070795","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Death, Ragdoll, Blood"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight in 64-player matches as the United States or the PAVN + Vietcong in a Conquest-style mode set during the Vietnam War. This demo features one large river delta map where helicopter transport is essential to reach the Vietnamese-held side, f